  "editor_review": "Prepare yourself for the ultimate experience of sports car driving with Extreme Car Driving Simulator! This captivating open-world car simulator, popular since 2014, features an advanced real physics engine that gives you the feeling of genuinely being behind the wheel of a high-speed sports car. Unlike other racing games, you won't face traffic or police pursuits. Instead, you can engage in thrilling stunts, drift at impressive speeds, and roam through an extensive open world without limitations. With authentic car damage and precise physics, this game is a dream come true for car aficionados. So fasten your seatbelt and get ready to hit the road!",
